# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FictionHub — ALLOWLIST gitignore
# This repo root is also a working Electron runtime (unpacked .dll/.pak/.exe),
# so we track ONLY source + build config and ignore everything else by default.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore every top-level entry, then re-include only what belongs in source.
# (Using /* — NOT "*" — so parent dirs can be re-included; git refuses to
#  re-include a file when its parent directory is excluded by a blanket * / */ )
/*
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!README.md
!package.json
!package-lock.json

# --- app source ---
!app-src/
!app-src/**

# --- Android project ---
!android/
!android/**

# --- CI workflow ---
!.github/
!.github/**

# --- but NEVER commit these inside app-src ---
app-src/node_modules/
app-src/build/
app-src/dist/
app-src/android/
app-src/fh-backup.json

# --- safety: never commit build outputs / logs / runtime anywhere ---
dist/
build-output.log
build-error.log
*.log
node_modules/
